|                                    CENTRAL VAULT ERP                                  |
|                 Real-Time Interbank Rate Ingestion (FIX 4.4 / REST)                   |
|                 Global Ledger & AML Compliance Engine                                |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
           ▲                               ▲                               ▲
           │                               │                               │
           ▼                               ▼                               ▼
+---------------------+         +---------------------+         +---------------------+
|  COUNTER 1: RETAIL  |         |  COUNTER 2: VIP/HNW |         | COUNTER 3: EXPRESS  |
|  - Standard Spreads |         |  - Tight Spreads    |         |  - Pre-Order Pickup |
