### 10.1 Regulatory Audit Compliance Features

* **Write Once, Read Many (WORM) Storage:** Every finalized transaction slip and denomination snapshot is hashed via SHA-256 and committed to tamper-evident audit storage.
* **Central Bank Reporting Feed:** End-of-day data pipelines compile aggregate foreign currency inflows and outflows into standardized ISO 20022 XML formats ready for regulatory dispatch.
